n\\\":\\\"Open\\\",\\\"developers_open_dashboard\\\":\\\"Open Dashboard\\\",\\\"developers_page_eyebrow\\\":\\\"Developers\\\",\\\"developers_page_lede\\\":\\\"Libraries, APIs, and downloads to help you build your apps.\\\",\\\"developers_page_title\\\":\\\"Built for Developers\\\",\\\"developers_preview\\\":\\\"Sections Preview\\\",\\\"developers_preview_empty\\\":\\\"No preview yet.\\\",\\\"developers_readme\\\":\\\"Library README\\\",\\\"developers_readme_error\\\":\\\"Failed to load README.\\\",\\\"developers_readme_url\\\":\\\"README URL\\\",\\\"developers_sections_count\\\":\\\"Sections:\\\",\\\"developers_title\\\":\\\"Developers\\\",\\\"developers_updated\\\":\\\"Last update:\\\",\\\"developers_upload_json\\\":\\\"Upload JSON\\\",\\\"developers_validate_json\\\":\\\"Validate\\\",\\\"developers_version\\\":\\\"Version:\\\",\\\"developers_view_docs\\\":\\\"View full documentation\\\",\\\"download_page_title\\\":\\\"I-download ang App\\\",\\\"downloads\\\":\\\"Downloads\\\",\\\"dwaaDaily\\\":\\\"Dua ng Araw\\\",\\\"Email\\\":\\\"Email\\\",\\\"Error\\\":\\\"Error\\\",\\\"errorLoadingData\\\":\\\"Error sa pag-load ng data\\\",\\\"faq\\\":\\\"FAQ\\\",\\\"faq_a1\\\":\\\"Mula sa theme icon sa upper bar.\\\",\\\"faq_a10\\\":\\\"Pinapangalagaan namin ang privacy ng inyong data at hindi namin ito ibinabahagi sa third parties, at gumagamit kami ng trusted infrastructure.\\\",\\\"faq_a11\\\":\\\"Bank transfer at common electronic payment gateways depende sa bansa.\\\",\\\"faq_a12\\\":\\\"Mula sa \\\\\\\"Contact\\\\\\\" tab sa loob ng website, ang inyong mensahe ay direktang naaabot sa aming team nang hindi binubuksan ang mail app.\\\",\\\"faq_a2\\\":\\\"Ang ilang mga seksyon ay gumagana nang walang internet pagkatapos ng initial loading.\\\",\\\"faq_a3\\\":\\\"Mula sa search box o mula sa Quran tab.\\\",\\\"faq_a4\\\":\\\"Oo, ang interface ay responsive para sa lahat ng laki.\\\",\\\"faq_a5\\\":\\\"Magpadala sa amin ng summary sa pamamagitan ng \\\\\\\"Simulan ang inyong project\\\\\\\" na button at babalik kami sa inyo sa loob ng 24-48 oras na may malinaw na mga hakbang.\\\",\\\"faq_a6\\\":\\\"Target namin ang iOS, Android, at Web mula sa isang codebase na may optimization para sa bawat platform.\\\",\\\"faq_a7\\\":\\\"Depende sa laki at saklaw ng project; karaniwang 2 hanggang 8 linggo para sa maliliit at medium na mga project.\\\",\\\"faq_a8\\\":\\\"Ayon sa saklaw at mga kinakailangang features. Nagpapadala kami ng detalyadong price quote pagkatapos maintindihan ang mga requirements.\\\",\\\"faq_a9\\\":\\\"Oo, nag-o-offer kami ng monthly maintenance plans o on-demand para sa mga updates, improvements, at bug fixes.\\\",\\\"faq_api_a\\\":\\\"Yes, we provide the open-source quran_library, and an API for the Quran dataset. Developers can explore them from the \\\\\\\"Developers\\\\\\\" section.\\\",\\\"faq_api_q\\\":\\\"Do you offer an API for developers?\\\",\\\"faq_apps_a\\\":\\\"Yes, all our apps are available on the Apple App Store, Google Play, and Huawei AppGallery. You can browse them from the \\\\\\\"Our Apps\\\\\\\" section.\\\",\\\"faq_apps_q\\\":\\\"Are the apps available on iOS and Android?\\\",\\\"faq_contact_a\\\":\\\"You can contact us via the \\\\\\\"Contact Us\\\\\\\" page, and we are happy to hear your feedback and suggestions to improve our services.\\\",\\\"faq_contact_q\\\":\\\"How can I contact you?\\\",\\\"faq_data_a\\\":\\\"We source our data from trusted and approved sources, and provide part of it to developers via an open API.\\\",\\\"faq_data_q\\\":\\\"Where does your data come from?\\\",\\\"faq_eyebrow\\\":\\\"FAQ\\\",\\\"faq_free_a\\\":\\\"Yes, all Alheekmah Library services are completely free and free of annoying ads. We aim to spread beneficial knowledge without any financial obstacles, as a dedication for the sake of Allah.\\\",\\\"faq_free_q\\\":\\\"Is Alheekmah Library completely free to use?\\\",\\\"faq_lede\\\":\\\"Everything you want to know about Alheekmah Library and its services.\\\",\\\"faq_offline_a\\\":\\\"Our mobile apps work offline after the initial download. The website requires a connection.\\\",\\\"faq_offline_q\\\":\\\"Can I use the apps offline?\\\",\\\"faq_page_eyebrow\\\":\\\"FAQ\\\",\\\"faq_page_lede\\\":\\\"Answers to the most common questions about Alheekmah Library.\\\",\\\"faq_page_title\\\":\\\"Everything You Need to Know\\\",\\\"faq_q1\\\":\\\"Paano magpalit sa pagitan ng light at dark theme?\\\",\\\"faq_q10\\\":\\\"Paano ang tungkol sa data privacy?\\\",\\\"faq_q11\\\":\\\"Anong mga payment methods ang available?\\\",\\\"faq_q12\\\":\\\"Paano makikipag-ugnayan sa inyo nang direkta?\\\",\\\"faq_q2\\\":\\\"Gumagana ba ito nang walang internet?\\\",\\\"faq_q3\\\":\\\"Paano maghanap sa loob ng Quran?\\\",\\\"faq_q4\\\":\\\"May mode ba para sa phone at computer?\\\",\\\"faq_q5\\\":\\\"Paano magsisimula ng app project kasama ninyo?\\\",\\\"faq_q6\\\":\\\"Anong mga platform ang inyong sinusuportahan?\\\",\\\"faq_q7\\\":\\\"Gaano katagal ang application development?\\\",\\\"faq_q8\\\":\\\"Paano natutukoy ang presyo?\\\",\\\"faq_q9\\\":\\\"Nagbibigay ba kayo ng maintenance at updates?\\\",\\\"faq_tafsir_a\\\":\\\"Yes, we provide multiple tafsirs (Ibn Kathir, Al-Muyassar, Al-Saadi...) and translations in more than 10 languages, with the ability to switch between them easily while reading.\\\",\\\"faq_tafsir_q\\\":\\\"Is tafsir and translation available for the Holy Quran?\\\",\\\"faq_title\\\":\\\"Mga Madalas na Tanong\\\",\\\"faq_title_1\\\":\\\"Answers to your\\\",\\\"faq_title_2\\\":\\\"questions\\\",\\\"feature_clean_title\\\":\\\"Ad-free experience\\\",\\\"feature_multilang_title\\\":\\\"Multilingual\\\",\\\"feature_opensource_title\\\":\\\"Open for developers\\\",\\\"feature_trusted_title\\\":\\\"Trusted content\\\",\\\"footer_desc\\\":\\\"A comprehensive Islamic platform for spreading beneficial knowledge and serving the Book of Allah and the Sunnah of His Prophet ﷺ, through trusted content and a refined user experience.\\\",\\\"footer_made_with\\\":\\\"Crafted with care to serve the Book of Allah\\\",\\\"footnotes\\\":\\\"Mga Talababa\\\",\\\"goToStartOfJuz\\\":\\\"Pumunta sa simula ng bahagi\\\",\\\"greenBookmarks\\\":\\\"Berdeng Mga Bookmark\\\",\\\"hadiths\\\":\\\"Hadith\\\",\\\"hero_ayah_ref\\\":\\\"Surah Ar-Ra'd · 28\\\",\\\"hero_ayah_text\\\":\\\"“Verily, in the remembrance of Allah do hearts find rest”\\\",\\\"hero_badge\\\":\\\"Comprehensive Islamic Platform\\\",\\\"hero_subtitle\\\":\\\"Ginagawa namin ang inyong ideya bilang pinong digital na karanasan na gumagana nang maayos sa iOS, Android, Web, at Desktop na may mataas na kalidad at performance.\\\",\\\"hero_title\\\":\\\"Gumagawa kami ng propesyonal na apps para sa mobile, web, at desktop\\\",\\\"hero_title_1\\\":\\\"Where the\\\",\\\"hero_title_2\\\":\\\"Quran\\\",\\\"hero_title_3\\\":\\\"is recited and wisdom is written\\\",\\\"hizb\\\":\\\"Hizb\\\",\\\"home\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"index\\\":\\\"Indeks\\\",\\\"invalid_email\\\":\\\"Hindi valid ang email address\\\",\\\"juz\\\":\\\"Juz\\\",\\\"juzz\\\":\\\"Mga Bahagi\\\",\\\"last_listen\\\":\\\"Huling Pakikinig\\\",\\\"lastRead\\\":\\\"Huling Binasa\\\",\\\"myLibrary\\\":\\\"Aking Library\\\",\\\"ninthBooks\\\":\\\"Ikasiyam na mga Libro\\\",\\\"no_bookmarks_yet\\\":\\\"Walang bookmark pa\\\",\\\"noBooksDownloaded\\\":\\\"Wala pang mga libro na na-download\\\",\\\"noBooksFoundForSearch\\\":\\\"Walang nahanap na mga libro para sa search na ito.\\\",\\\"noBooksReadedYet\\\":\\\"Wala pang mga libro na nabasa\\\",\\\"noChaptersInThisJuz\\\":\\\"Walang mga kabanata sa bahaging ito\\\",\\\"noPagesFound\\\":\\\"Walang nahanap na mga pahina para sa librong ito.\\\",\\\"not_found_ayah\\\":\\\"“And whoever fears Allah — He will make for him a way out and will provide for him from where he does not expect”\\\",\\\"not_found_ayah_ref\\\":\\\"Surah At-Talaq · 2-3\\\",\\\"not_found_desc\\\":\\\"Sorry, the page you are looking for does not exist or has been moved. You might find what you are lookin